# Cal theme (overrides `design.md` where they conflict)

Source: `design/sources/DESIGN-cal.md` (Cal.com **marketing** analysis). Use it as **product visual language**, not as a landing page.

Master map: `.cursor/scopes/cal-theme/SCOPE.md`  
Load **one child scope** for the slice you are implementing. Do not ingest every child file on every task.

This rule **overrides** `design.md` §0.2 nested-card ban, §0.4 “Dark only”, §3 dark-only ink, §4 JetBrains Mono as required data face, and “no nested cards” in `AGENTS.md`. Architecture (sessions, RBAC, math, sync) is **not** overridden.

## Locked (do not re-litigate)

| Topic | Verdict |
| :--- | :--- |
| Sequence | **Phase A then Phase B.** A = Calendar + AppShell + dialogs. B = rest of app (session editor, Sessions, Insights, Security). Same tokens from day one. |
| Theme | **Light and dark**, user toggle. Persist `al_theme` (`light` \| `dark`) device-scoped in LocalStorage UI prefs — **not** athlete-scoped, not IndexedDB. Default **`light`**. No `system` third state in Phase A. |
| Primary | **Black** `#111111` (dark theme: invert to near-white fill on dark). Focus rings, links, in-progress, sync pulse stay **blue** (`brand-accent` / existing `#007AFF`). |
| Type | **No JetBrains Mono as the training-number face.** UI + numbers = **Inter** with `font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums`. Titles = Inter 600 + negative tracking (Cal Sans substitute). Trial 2 only if columns drift: IBM Plex Sans. Keep JetBrains as unused fallback, not the grid. |
| Nested cards | **Allowed. No numeric max.** Nest along the product tree (Block → Week → Session; day → session → lifts). Do not wrap the same object twice. Overlays are not cards. No decorative hero, no gradient orbs, no marketing landing. See `10-nested-cards.md`. |
| Density (was “dunno”) | Phase A: **keep current day `min-h` / 7-col grid**; Cal skin + nested inner cards. Do not jump to 96px marketing section padding. Revisit after A ships. |
| Marketing | **No.** No hero, pricing, dark-footer-as-app-chrome, testimonials. |
| Product behavior | Hover overlay, copy D1, day notes, Day vs Name, `use {n}`, `%`, Adj, 6-col keyboard, sync overlay — **unchanged** unless a child scope says otherwise. |

## Agent load order

1. This rule + `SCOPE.md` (index only).
2. The **one** child scope for the slice (`01-tokens.md` …).
3. Mapped implementation files from that child. Stop.

## Non-goals (whole program)

- Cal Sans webfont (unlicensed). Telegram as theme driver. Sheets as store. Demo seed. Growing `COLS`. Auto-write Plan kg.
